OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of synagogue attack victim
OL,4,Acall for 'day of kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man killed in the
OL,7,FManchester synagogue attack have called
OL,8,Ffor people to mark the first
OL,9,Fanniversary of his death with acts of
OL,10,Fkindness.
OL,12,FMelvin Cravitz, 66, was stabbed to
OL,13,Fdeath by 35-year-old Jihad Al-Shamie
OL,14,Foutside Heaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,15,FSynagogue on 2 October last year.
OL,17,FA second victim, 53-year-old Adrian
OL,18,FDaulby, was fatally wounded by a stray
OL,19,Fbullet fired by armed police as he
OL,20,Fhelped to block the synagogue doors.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
