OL,3,GNEWSAFamily of synagogue attack victim
OL,4,Acall for 'day of kindness'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSyrian-born UK citizen Al-Shamie was
OL,7,Fshot dead during the rampage, which
OL,8,Ftook place on Yom Kippur, the holiest
OL,9,Fday of the year for Jews.
